# Keep the Cloud Build upload context lean. Images need: pyproject.toml,
# README.md, suite/ (incl. the generic sample inputs), project/resources/schemas/,
# web/ (console image), deploy/ (Dockerfile).
# NOTE: gitignore semantics — unrooted `infra/` would also match suite/infra
# (that bug shipped an image without the infra package). Keep patterns ROOTED.
/.git/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
/.venv/
/infra/
/tests/
/docs/
/exports/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.DS_Store
/suite/runs/
/web/db.sqlite3
/web/staticfiles/
/infra/.venv/
